Package: tundraux3
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TundraUX3 contributors <maintainers@tundraux3.invalid>
Depends: xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin, libpam0g, libpam-modules, libpam-runtime, libpam-systemd, libc-bin, systemd, dbus, dbus-user-session, curl, policycoreutils, libseat1, libdrm2, libudev1, libxkbcommon0, zlib1g, libpango-1.0-0, libpangoft2-1.0-0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6
Recommends: gh (>= 2.87.3), fonts-noto-cjk, xdg-desktop-portal
Description: User desktop with opt-in Linux PAM sessions and authorized system services
 TundraUX3 runs its UX with ordinary user credentials. Independent seat mode
 uses a private pinned kmscon built with libseat; distro kmscon is never used.
 Installation creates service accounts and installs units but never starts a seat
 or replaces the existing display manager. System updates require a recent gh CLI.
